# Father Olaf, Terra Vitae's preacher. R2: warms to you after Lucy gets Burton's tag back, refuses you if you sold it and she found out.

%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: HasFlag('terra_vitae_cold')
goto: Cold

cond: HasFlag('terra_vitae_friend')
goto: Warm

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: (A tall man in a coat stitched from old flags.) Life finds a way, child. Even in here. Even after the cleansing.
# >>> pack f
#
o_text: (Give him the Chiba chip.) These are the names of who gets to leave.
o_id: olaf_take_chip
o_cond: HasItem('chiba_chip')
o_goto: OlafChip
# <<< pack f
#
o_text: What cleansing?
o_id: ask_cleansing
o_goto: Cleansing
#
o_text: Is there work?
o_id: ask_work
o_goto: Work
#
o_text: Bless you, Father.
o_id: bye
o_goto: Exit

name: Cleansing
npc: The dome was full, they said. So EBI sealed the south gate and let the air do the rest. Hundreds.
+ They still lie out there between the airlocks. The gate captain guards them like they might run off.
#
o_text: Why guard the dead?
o_id: why_guard
o_goto: WhyGuard
#
o_text: I see.
o_id: cleansing_bye
o_goto: Exit

name: WhyGuard
npc: Because the dead have faces, and faces have names, and names end up in Richard Shaw's collection and on the news.
+ Ask Lucy about her boy. Gently.
#
o_text: I will.
o_id: why_guard_bye
o_goto: Exit

name: Work
npc: Lucy Burton needs a kindness more than you need money. Speak with her.
#
o_text: I'll talk to her.
o_id: work_bye
o_goto: Exit

name: Warm
npc: The one who brought Burton home. (He grips your shoulder.) Our doors are yours. Take this, from the commune garden. It's not much.
effect: SetFlag('olaf_blessing')
#
o_text: (Accept.)
o_id: accept_gift
o_cond: !HasFlag('olaf_gift_given')
o_goto: Gift
#
o_text: Thank you, Father.
o_id: warm_bye
o_goto: Exit

name: Gift
npc: (A jar of something green and a small bottle of something stronger.) Go gently.
effect: PlayerAddItem('binge')
effect: PlayerAddItem('meld')
effect: SetFlag('olaf_gift_given')
effect: EndConversation

name: Cold
npc: (He looks through you.) There's nothing for you here. Lucy told us. Go and sell someone else's grief.
effect: EndConversation

name: Exit
npc: Life finds a way.
effect: EndConversation

# >>> pack f
name: OlafChip
npc: (He reads for a long time.) None of ours. Not one. (He closes his eyes.) Then we stop waiting for the ships. Thank you. Terra Vitae will remember.
effect: StackTransferTo(NPC, 'chiba_chip', 1)
effect: SetFlag('slow_boat_olaf')
effect: SetFlag('terra_vitae_friend')
effect: EndConversation
# <<< pack f
